  "model_output": "```sql\nWITH parks_in_sangamon AS (\n  SELECT \n    id,\n    park_name,\n    geometry\n  FROM parks\n  WHERE \n    ST_Intersects(geometry::geometry, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-89.704796, 39.767257), 4326)::geography)\n    AND park_name ILIKE '%theme park%'\n    AND EXISTS (\n      SELECT 1\n      FROM regions\n      WHERE \n        regions.border_type = 'county'\n        AND regions.region_name = 'Sangamon'\n        AND regions.addr_state = 'IL'\n        AND ST_Intersects(regions.geometry, parks.geometry)\n    )\n),\nslope_analysis AS (\n  SELECT\n    p.id,\n    p.park_name,\n    ST_Slope(\n      ST_Clip(public.dem_us.rast, p.geometry::geometry),\n      1\n    ) AS slope_rast\n  FROM parks_in_sangamon p\n  JOIN public.dem_us\n    ON ST_Intersects(public.dem_us.rast, p.geometry::geometry)\n),\nslope_stats AS (\n  SELECT\n    id,\n    park_name,\n    MAX((slope_rast).val) AS max_slope\n  FROM slope_analysis\n  GROUP BY id, park_name\n)\nSELECT \n  park_name,\n  max_slope\nFROM slope_stats\nORDER BY max_slope DESC\nLIMIT 3;\n```",
